/T (Identify and prioritize dead and dyingnaulas, springs, and streams in the watershed. Assess the status of springs and streamsand identify potential recharge areas. Develop a GIScience based decision support system for rejuvenation planning. Implement and monitor rejuvenation measures in association with local inhabitants and Gram Panchayats to improve water availability and reduce land degradation and improve the economy of the local inhabitants. To mitigate the adverse impacts of climate change in hydrology, in particular, and the physical and human environment in general. )
/E (Identify and prioritize dead and dyingnaulas, springs, and streams in the watershed. Assess the status of springs and streamsand identify potential recharge areas. Develop a GIScience based decision support system for rejuvenation planning. Implement and monitor rejuvenation measures in association with local inhabitants and Gram Panchayats to improve water availability and reduce land degradation and improve the economy of the local inhabitants. To mitigate the adverse impacts of climate change in hydrology, in particular, and the physical and human environment in general. )
/Pg 11 0 R
