/T (How to rejuvenate the dying springs/stream and steadily dwindling rivers of the rain fed watersheds ? This report is a modest attempt towards addressing this crucial problem which aims to develop a model of scientific integrated strategy for rejuvenation of springs, streams and rivers. For this purpose, a rain fed river watershed of the Kumaun Lesser Himalaya \(in district Bageshwar, Uttarakhad State\), vi.z.,the Dhargad river watershedhas been employed as a natural laboratory. The fundamental objectives of this work are as follows:)
